            "description": "'auto' is the right choice in almost all cases. auto: automatically switches among 'semantic', 'lexical' and 'reference'. semantic: meaning + keyword hybrid, quoted phrases filter presence. lexical: keyword-only, every word required, quoted phrases exact, ET / AND / OU / OR / SAUF / NOT / PROCHE5 / NEAR5 / répar*. reference: lookup by identity, on the docket number, the ECLI, the case name, or the court and the date.",
            "enum": [
              "auto",
              "lexical",
              "semantic",
              "reference"
            ],
            "type": "string"
          },
          "publication": {
            "anyOf": [
              {
